@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiKey = cambiar_este_token_por_uno_seguro

### 1. Simular Marcaje Empleado 101
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hikvision/simular-marcaje?id_empleado=101
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 2. Simular Marcaje Duplicado (Ejecutar de inmediato)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hikvision/simular-marcaje?id_empleado=101
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 3. Webhook ISAPI Event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hikvision/webhook
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "AccessControllerEvent": {
    "employeeNoString": "202",
    "dateTime": "2026-09-14T10:00:00",
    "ipAddress": "192.168.20.215"
  }
}

### 4. Consultar Reporte TXT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hikvision/reporte-respaldo
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 5. Prueba de Seguridad (Debe retornar 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hikvision/reporte-respaldo
X-API-Key: clave_incorrecta